    }
  ],
  "notes": "エコバッグ is a wasei-eigo (Japanese-made English) combining \"eco\" and \"bag.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {折|お}りたたみエコバッグ: foldable eco bag\n- {保冷|ほれい}エコバッグ: insulated eco bag\n- エコバッグを{持参|じさん}する: to bring one's own bag\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nSince July 2020, Japan made plastic shopping bags (レジ{袋|ぶくろ}) chargeable at stores. This significantly increased eco bag usage. Many stores sell original eco bags, and they've become a popular promotional item.",
